  "details": "I've had this issue for a while that my sliders changed unexpectedly when i moved left/right in vrchat via my joystick.\n\nThen i randomly stumbled upon this section in the docs:\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/components/vrc_uishape/#if-the-ui-is-moving-when-you-move-press-a-key-or-move-a-joystick\n\nAfter setting `Navigation` to `None` to all of my UI elements, the problem seems to be gone.\n\nI propose showing a warning in the 'Review Any Alerts' section, to catch this problem early.",
